{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5a171871eb1b29cbb5e61540cf89091b73d44dff46cbf9241d300d8c82cd99d3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8977615cad6fbc851a9e1eb7e29f227183302cd54983ca33f2b6c022e8dc76",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316e5d93be07c788115fabbfb1fcead747e84e79701cfe0aff13fa63a27f505f",
      "text": "关于活动后带回来的道具，\n我遵照你的建议将照片发布在社交媒体上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7562c95a5ee33bb53571744a5d1d9d23c293ebbb6119ef07eec0a0b48656d1e3",
      "text": "引起了相当大的\n反响呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6658ca98a057249cf3ca76511ae7ac003956b69a7c5c6fadd5000146a2ca6c1d",
      "text": "嗯。我查看的时候，\n来自原作游戏粉丝的评论占了多数。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc6c7635cb456982880e6cf9710509882f880c236b7fb93ef2c6a4318646331",
      "text": "粉丝群体\n拓宽了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4410e9f5fe12aaab1b6598f2fced09d27c2c7eea4675dc1957f5f01f579fe808",
      "text": "这证明呈现了\n一场优秀的演出呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f1cbcbd378680bda0a5471f45a5a437de19519b0a43951ca5ffa6b103a737ed",
      "text": "确实如此。就连我自己，\n也变得想要更深入地了解那个世界了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b646794bd3e0cb68c73cdb0e65127857ba5087904e1d970ebca776038790ed81",
      "text": "听秀说，市面上有详细整理了世界观和出场人物设定的书籍出版。此外……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90031ac2ad276838aacf657b0d4f1d546e2259d3e3ae94b50af3e07ee43242a1",
      "text": "他还说如果不每天练习，游戏技术就会生疏。\n那样未免太可惜，所以我打算定期练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_b:2_4_049_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c60c4735f1e262181205a7f109c70f3f77a4fb09360697f08f985f994c6d3ce",
      "text": "你要是想玩的话也可以随时叫我。\n我来陪你。那么，先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
